<!-- page.hbs -->
{{!< default}}
{{#post}}
<article class="gh-article {{post_class}}">
    {{#match @page.show_title_and_feature_image}}
    <header class="gh-header gh-canvas">
        <h1 class="gh-title">{{title}}</h1>

        {{#if custom_excerpt}}
            <p class="gh-excerpt">{{custom_excerpt}}</p>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if feature_image}}
            <figure class="gh-feature-image">
                <img src="{{feature_image}}" alt="{{#if feature_image_alt}}{{feature_image_alt}}{{else}}{{title}}{{/if}}" />
                {{#if feature_image_caption}}
                    <figcaption>{{feature_image_caption}}</figcaption>
                {{/if}}
            </figure>
        {{/if}}
    </header>
    {{/match}}

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #4a4a4a;
            background-color: #faf9f7;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            color: #8b6f47;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .last-updated {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            color: #8b6f47;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        ul {
            margin-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .contact-info {
            background-color: #f4f1ed;
            padding: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid #8b6f47;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
    </style>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last updated: November 2025</p>

        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Welcome to Aunty Suzy. We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring you have a positive experience on our website. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal data.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
            Aunty Suzy is operated as a sole trader business in the United Kingdom. We are the data controller for any personal information you provide to us.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect personal data in the following ways:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Order Information:</strong> When you purchase through Snipcart, we collect your name, email, address, and payment information (processed securely by Snipcart)</li>
            <li><strong>Newsletter Signup:</strong> If you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address</li>
            <li><strong>Contact Forms:</strong> Information you provide when contacting us via our support page</li>
            <li><strong>Website Usage:</strong> We use cookies and analytics to understand how you interact with our site</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>Your personal data is used for:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Processing and fulfilling your orders</li>
            <li>Sending you order updates and newsletters (with your consent)</li>
            <li>Responding to your enquiries</li>
            <li>Improving our website and products</li>
            <li>Complying with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Data Protection & Security</h2>
        <p>
            We take data protection seriously. All payment information is handled securely through Snipcart's encrypted payment processing. We do not store credit card details on our servers. Your data is protected in accordance with the UK Data Protection Act 2018 and UK GDPR.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Under UK GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access your personal data</li>
            <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
            <li>Unsubscribe from our newsletter</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at the details below.</p>

        <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
            We use Snipcart for payment processing and order management. Snipcart processes your data in accordance with their own privacy policy. We do not share your data with any other third parties without your explicit consent.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
            We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience. For detailed information about cookies, please see our Cookie Policy.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
        <div class="contact-info">
            <p><strong>Aunty Suzy</strong></p>
            <p>Email: info@auntysuzy.co.uk</p>
            <p>For data privacy enquiries, please contact us with "Data Request" in the subject line.</p>
        </div>

        <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any significant changes via email or by posting the new policy on our website.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gh-content gh-canvas">
        {{content}}
    </div>
</article>
{{/post}}